SEARCH_DATE: 2026-06-08
PAPERS_FOUND: 12 total (High: 5, Medium: 5, Low: 2)
SEARCH_SOURCES: SEP, IEP, PhilPapers, Semantic Scholar, OpenAlex, CORE, arXiv, WebSearch
